<!--
  Empty on purpose, and it is the point of this file existing. MSBuild walks up for the nearest
  Directory.Build.props, and finding Jint's own would give these two recording harnesses Jint's
  TreatWarningsAsErrors, artifacts layout, SourceLink, version, signing and implicit usings. They are
  disposable tools that drive a browser and write JSON; none of that applies, and inheriting it would mean
  every change to Jint's build could break a tool that is not part of the product. The walk stops here.
-->
